flowchart LR
  n1[Collect raw sensor readings] --> n2[Remove outliers beyond three sigma]
  n2 --> n3[Resample to one minute buckets]
  n3 --> n4[Join with the weather station table]
  n4 --> n5[Compute rolling averages]
  n5 --> n6[Write parquet partitions]
  n6 --> n7[Publish the daily report]
  n3 --> n8[Flag gaps longer than ten minutes]
  n8 --> n7
  n4 --> n9[Alert on-call if the join drops rows]
